From 05be341ff591776cf11aac95fc0732e203a50dc6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: George Scriven <george.w.scriven@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:03:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PROTOTYPE: PrKF magnet crossing (UT->T) through K Nystrom
 steps + a network correction

Off by default (full_kalman_filter property magnet_nn_weights empty). With a JSON
weights file the second-pass magnet crossing (last UT hit -> first SciFi hit) uses
allen_nn::propagate_magnet instead of the adaptive RKN, with an RKN fallback outside
the training box or when a fixed step's error estimate is above a threshold.
Catch2 tests [magnet_nn] check the transport matrix against finite differences.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
